'''Ribbon Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be obtained from clicking the [[13th Anniv. Doge Cake]] in the [[Anniversary/13th Year|13th Anniversary]]'s in-game announcement poster. She was added in [[Version 15.0 Update|Version 15.0]] for [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] and in [[Version 15.4 Update|Version 15.4]] for [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]].

