==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Pink Nyanko Ranger''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
This Cat is an anti-[[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]]/[[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]]/[[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] crowd-controller with a surprisingly large effective range through [[Long Distance]]. Pink Nyanko Ranger has a guaranteed chance to [[Weaken]] said target traits within her effective range with a ~61% uptime, which can be decently useful against Red and Dark enemies, who are usually encountered in droves. She has a good enough effective range to snipe oncoming enemies and outrange most common melee threats (even using them as stepping stones to hit backliners). Pink Nyanko Ranger's blind spot is small enough to where it is very difficult for enemies to infiltrate it without already being close enough to target the unit directly.

The main problems with this unit are her survivability and recharge time: Pink Nyanko Ranger's HP is terrible, and any unweakened enemy that hits her is guaranteed to put her out of commission until the end of her recharge. This means that she usually can't function as your solo crowd-controller unless you can keep your stack of them alive indefinitely. Additionally, a lack of [[Surge Attack|Surge]] Immunity makes proper usage against a majority of threatening Aku apart from [[Aku Gory]] very difficult. This is without mentioning the fact that many Aku outrange this unit and/or have [[Shield]]s that render her crowd-control irrelevant.

Even Pink Nyanko Ranger's Unit Speed UP XL [[Cat Combo|Combo]] lacks much of a purpose, as speed is not a point of concern for [[:Category:Nyanko Rangers|Nyanko Rangers]] in most situations. However, this cat does benefit from the [[Wave Attack|Wave]] Immunity provided by [[Helmet Cat (Special Cat)|Yellow Nyanko Ranger]]'s Cat Combo, and they function well in tandem with [[Goggles Cat (Special Cat)|Green Nyanko Ranger]] to provide a solid line of defense against Reds and Darks.

With this, she can serve as a good supplemental crowd-controller in {{4c}} restriction stages. Outside of that, the [[Underground Labyrinth]] is the best place to use this unit.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller & Combo Slave}}

