==Trivia==
*Despite Ribbon Cat's Japanese description claiming she is the only female [[:Category:Nyanko Rangers|Nyanko Ranger]] (紅一点 ''kōitten'' means the only female member of a group), [[Commander Cat (Special Cat)|Commander Cat]]'s Japanese description contains the word 才色兼備 ''saishokukenbi'', meaning a woman who is both intelligent and beautiful.

